{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20072","headline":"送谏议十六叔至孝义渡後奉寄 · 孟郊","name":"送谏议十六叔至孝义渡後奉寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓渡明镜中，霞衣相飘颻。\n浪凫惊亦双，蓬客将谁僚。\n别饮孤易醒，离忧壮难销。\n文清虽无敌，儒贵不敢骄。\n江吏捧紫泥，海旗剪红蕉。\n分明太守礼，跨蹑毗陵桥。\n伊洛去未回，遐瞩空寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}